                    "NEVER fabricate results: every number MUST come from rows returned by run_hana_sql. If a query errors, FIX the SQL and retry; if you still cannot obtain real rows, state that the query failed — do not guess or invent counts.\n\n"
                    "DEMO ENVIRONMENT CONTEXT:\n"
                    "Fivetran\'s S/4HANA IDES demo — Order-to-Cash data is auto-generated by a 5-step BAPI daemon\n"
                    "(SalesOrder → Delivery → GoodsIssue → Billing → Payment). Data is intentionally rich:\n"
